Z||000004||Eric||02-03-2001||07:58 PM||||Daytona is the best thing that's happened to me all day.  I've got a little head cold and I can't go out drinking tonight, so I just flip on Speedvision, turn down the volume, and listen to music.  Roger, you'll appreciate this.  Was trying to do some instrument work this morning with inner ear blockage.  Kept getting vertigo under the hood, so I did a crappy job of hitting the glideslope on the ILS.  First time ever with that problem.  Next time I'll make sure I'm physically well before I fly without being able to see  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
