Z||000007||rogergarrison||02-04-2001||01:42 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by bHooper:<BR><B>yeah... i'm jealous!  usually, i'm the one with all the TV chanels that no one has.  this will be the first year in 7, that i've missed the race!<P>arrgghhh... and there not even broadcasting it on the net!  <P>so, can you give us updates? <P>please, please, please????<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ferrari has been in 1st or 2nd all day.<BR>Earnhart Jr went out in rain and dark on slicks and spun out twice before he got past the first turn, lol. But they are in second place in class w/C5 Vette. Had to just change a blown trans.<BR>One guy in a Porsche did a flip with another car going under him while he was in the air.<P>tv says its got coverage on web at <A HREF="http://www.speedvision.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.speedvision.com</A> ||||reg||1
